OL,3,GNEWSAAdmiral insurance firm to cut 500
OL,4,Ajobs in the UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FInsurer Admiral will cut 500 jobs in
OL,7,Fthe UK to save #100m, it has announced.
OL,9,FThe proposals are related to Admiral's
OL,10,FUK insurance business only, and will
OL,11,Faffect about 5% of its workforce.
OL,13,F"We recognise this will be a difficult
OL,14,Ftime for affected colleagues," said
OL,15,FAlistair Hargreaves, Admiral Insurance
OL,16,FUK's chief executive.
OL,18,FWhile the Cardiff-based company uses
OL,19,Fartificial intelligence (AI) in its
OL,20,Foperations, adoption of AI is not
OL,21,Fbelieved to be responsible for these
OL,22,Fchanges.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
